1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:05,497
Even the tips are included at this Cancun
all-inclusive, and so is the minibar in

2
00:00:05,527 --> 00:00:06,243
every room.

3
00:00:06,373 --> 00:00:11,933
This is Dreams Sands Cancun Resort and
Spa, a five star all-inclusive on the
beach

4
00:00:11,963 --> 00:00:13,024
in Punta Cancun.

5
00:00:13,154 --> 00:00:17,213
Four outdoor pools, six restaurants, and a
spa, all in one place.

6
00:00:17,343 --> 00:00:20,967
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my
honest score comes at the end.

7
00:00:21,097 --> 00:00:22,552
Start with your room.

8
00:00:22,682 --> 00:00:26,168
There are four hundred fourteen rooms, and
many of them look out at the ocean.

9
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:30,826
Every room has a free stocked minibar,
with all beverages included, and room
service

10
00:00:30,856 --> 00:00:32,128
twenty-four hours a day.

11
00:00:32,258 --> 00:00:35,428
Bathrooms have a tub or a shower, and free
toiletries.

12
00:00:35,558 --> 00:00:38,813
Couples can book a honeymoon suite with a
private plunge pool.

13
00:00:38,943 --> 00:00:41,327
Guests rate the service nine out of ten.

14
00:00:41,457 --> 00:00:42,598
Now, the water.

15
00:00:42,921 --> 00:00:47,876
There are four outdoor pools, a children's
pool, and a hot tub, with a lifeguard on

16
00:00:47,906 --> 00:00:48,176
site.

17
00:00:48,306 --> 00:00:51,209
There is a swim-up bar and a poolside bar
too.

18
00:00:51,339 --> 00:00:54,754
Kayaking and sailing are included, and so
is beach volleyball.

19
00:00:54,884 --> 00:00:57,664
Expedia calls it a top rated beach
location.

20
00:00:57,794 --> 00:00:58,578
Now, food.

21
00:00:59,173 --> 00:01:03,848
Everything is included: buffet and a la
carte meals, snacks, and drinks.

22
00:01:03,978 --> 00:01:08,358
World Cafe is the buffet, serving
breakfast, lunch, and dinner, open daily.

23
00:01:08,488 --> 00:01:14,016
For dinner, Portofino is Italian, Himitsu
is Asian, El Patio is Mexican, and Gaucho

24
00:01:14,046 --> 00:01:15,154
is international.

25
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:17,483
And there is a bar and lounge to end the
night.

26
00:01:17,613 --> 00:01:22,640
The Pevonia spa has six treatment rooms,
with a steam room, a sauna, and a hot tub.

27
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:24,875
The gym offers fitness classes and yoga.

28
00:01:25,005 --> 00:01:30,138
There are also dance, cooking, and
language classes, plus theme parties and
shows.

29
00:01:30,268 --> 00:01:34,881
Plaza Caracol mall is a five minute walk,
the Convention Center is nine minutes, and

30
00:01:34,911 --> 00:01:36,207
Caracol Beach is eleven.

31
00:01:36,337 --> 00:01:40,799
Coco Bongo is eight hundred meters away,
and the Isla Mujeres ferry is six hundred

32
00:01:40,829 --> 00:01:41,183
meters.

33
00:01:41,313 --> 00:01:43,325
A few tips to enjoy it even more.

34
00:01:43,455 --> 00:01:47,775
Ask for an ocean front king room, which
scores eight point eight on Expedia.

35
00:01:47,905 --> 00:01:52,435
One guest mentioned rocky spots on the
beach, so water shoes are a smart idea.

36
00:01:52,565 --> 00:01:56,446
The airport is a thirty-seven minute
drive, and the area shuttle costs extra.

37
00:01:56,576 --> 00:01:59,217
So, is Dreams Sands Cancun worth it?

38
00:01:59,441 --> 00:02:04,169
On Expedia, guests give it eight point
four out of ten, from one thousand seven

39
00:02:04,199 --> 00:02:05,494
hundred fifty reviews.

40
00:02:05,624 --> 00:02:10,637
Service scores nine, cleanliness eight
point eight, and amenities eight point
four.

41
00:02:10,767 --> 00:02:12,799
My honest score is eight out of ten.

42
00:02:12,929 --> 00:02:17,040
It is great for couples and families who
want everything included, right on the

43
00:02:17,070 --> 00:02:17,355
beach.

44
00:02:17,485 --> 00:02:19,769
The link is in the description.
